  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, when multi-editing contact receivers, you can enable \"Write to Materials\" but cannot edit any properties. For a number of systems, it makes sense to allow for multi-editing the \"Target Renderers\" and \"Write Matching Tag Bitflags\" sections. The \"Shader Parameter Override\" would also be useful, but would have to come with a warning about clashing if multiple renderers have the same tag set, as it will behave unpredictably (an additional canny will be posted for this)",
